WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.701 --> 00:00:04.904
NARRATOR: Modsidi series scans
the world she needs to conquer.

00:00:08.575 --> 00:00:13.813
A young impala would
be the easiest target,

00:00:13.880 --> 00:00:15.615
but Modsidi wants more.

00:00:19.886 --> 00:00:22.722
[tense music]

00:00:31.431 --> 00:00:42.208
This ram is twice her size,
a trophy worthy of a queen

00:00:42.275 --> 00:00:46.079
for all to see.

00:00:46.146 --> 00:00:49.215
[tense music]

00:01:30.323 --> 00:01:33.426
Hold on, Modsidi.

00:01:33.493 --> 00:01:35.829
Finish it.

00:01:35.895 --> 00:01:39.365
[tense music]

00:01:49.742 --> 00:01:52.178
[chattering]

00:01:53.713 --> 00:01:55.348
Success at last.

00:01:58.284 --> 00:02:01.554
[triumphant music]

